clear
units metal
dimension 3
boundary f p p
atom_style atomic
read_data post_relax.data
include potentials/potential.interface_calibration_v0.inc
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
variable fmag atom sqrt(fx*fx+fy*fy+fz*fz)
compute Fmax all reduce max v_fmag
compute Fmean all reduce ave v_fmag
velocity all create 300.0 928475 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix bath all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal c_Fmax c_Fmean
thermo_modify format float %.10g lost error flush yes
dump traj all custom 100 trajectory_300K.dump id type x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz
dump_modify traj sort id
run 2000
unfix bath
undump traj
run 0
write_dump all custom post_300K.dump id type x y z vx vy vz fx fy fz modify sort id format float %.16e
write_data post_300K.data
write_restart post_300K.restart
